ow_access\": \"VN education market $12B+\", \"startup_cost\": \"$0\"}, {\"name\": \"9. B2B Lead Generation Service for VN Companies\", \"mechanism\": \"AI-powered outreach pipelines for VN export companies. Charge per qualified lead or monthly retainer.\", \"month1_action\": \"Learn Apollo.io + AI email writing. Approach 10 VN exporters. Offer free 50-lead pilot.\", \"month12_milestone\": \"5-8 retainer clients at $500-1.5K/mo = $4-8K MRR.\", \"compound_asset\": \"Targeting intelligence + industry templates + conversion data + client relationships.\", \"kill_criteria\": \"Free pilot zero leads after 500 emails = overhaul targeting. 3 failed pilots = wrong packaging.\", \"cashflow_speed\": \"Month 1-2\", \"durability_10yr\": \"high\", \"money_flow_access\": \"VN export sector $370B+\", \"startup_cost\": \"$0-50\"}, {\"name\": \"10. Portfolio Income Stacking\", \"mechanism\": \"Financial discipline: fixed % of ALL business income into yield assets from day 1. VN bonds (5-7%), global index funds (via Gotrade from $1), stablecoin yield (3-8%).\", \"month1_action\": \"Open TCBS/SSI account. Auto-allocate 20% of income to yield assets. Start with $50 in bonds + $50 in global index.\", \"month12_milestone\": \"$2-5K in diversified yield assets producing $10-30/mo passive.\", \"compound_asset\": \"Financial assets + compound interest + investing knowledge + discipline habit.\", \"kill_criteria\": \"Never kill. Reduce allocation % only if literally starving.\", \"cashflow_speed\": \"Immediate\", \"durability_10yr\": \"high\", \"money_flow_access\": \"Global capital markets $100T+\", \"startup_cost\": \"$50\"}]}"
