ient saves time/money → referrals → use templates → faster implementation → higher margin.\", \"massive_flow_connection\": \"Enterprise automation $20B+ globally. VN 3-5 years behind = adoption wave incoming.\", \"year3_defensibility\": \"VN process knowledge + 50+ templates + maintenance lock-in.\"}, {\"model\": \"5. Cross-Border Sourcing Agent\", \"compounds\": \"Supplier relationships deepen. QC expertise reduces defects. Logistics network optimizes. Buyer trust grows per shipment.\", \"flywheel\": \"Source → buyer profits → more/larger orders → better supplier terms → competitive pricing → more buyers → more leverage.\", \"massive_flow_connection\": \"VN export $370B+/year. US-China decoupling redirects $100B+ to Vietnam.\", \"year3_defensibility\": \"Verified supplier network + buyer trust from deliveries + logistics optimization.\"}, {\"model\": \"6. Micro-SaaS\", \"compounds\": \"User feedback drives improvement. Feature requests reveal adjacent needs. Codebase matures. Network effects if collaborative.\", \"flywheel\": \"Solve pain → users adopt → feedback → build → more users → word of mouth.\", \"massive_flow_connection\": \"VN enterprise transitioning from Excel to digital. Government digitalization push.\", \"year3_defensibility\": \"500+ users with switching costs + VN-specific compliance + language UX.\"}, {\"model\": \"7. Deal Flow Aggregator\", \"compounds\": \"Network density increases non-linearly. Each deal adds 2+ relationship nodes. Pattern recognition improves.\", \"flywheel\": \"Aggregate → subscribers → match buyer-seller → referral → both tell network → more flow → more subscribers.\", \"massive_flow_connection\": \"VN real estate $60B+/year. SME transfers estimated $5-10B annually.\", \"year3_defensibility\": \"500+ verified contacts + deal history database + trusted intermediary reputation.\"}, {\"model\": \"8. Education\", \"compounds\": \"Content library grows. Alumni become distribution. Teaching skill improves. Brand recognition builds