mmediately switch\",\"LEARN: Document what went wrong\",\"DO NOT: Take debt, buy courses, or invest in tools before generating first dollar\"],\"outcome\":\"$500 lost, 6-12 months lost, but with hard-won knowledge for attempt #2.\"}]}"
