tunity and under-indexed on execution barriers.\", \"[INFERRED] Missing cash_flow_mechanics dimension is the most dangerous gap.\", \"[INFERRED] Cross-border payment infrastructure (Wise, Payoneer, Stripe Atlas) has matured enough for VN founders to collect global revenue, but withdrawal fees eat thin margins.\"]}"
